            "hi": "NCERT §4.6.3 सारणी: वर्ग समतलीय, $dsp^2$: $\\ce{[Ni(CN)4]^2-}$ और $\\ce{[PtCl4]^2-}$।"
          }
        ],
        "shortcut": null,
        "shortcut_fails_when": null,
        "common_traps": [
          {
            "option_id": "b",
            "why": {
              "en": "Six ligands: octahedral.",
              "hi": "छह लिगंड: अष्टफलकीय।"
